    voice "2FU_1133"
    fumi "「——所以明天我要请假了。对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_ec683a4f:


    "文说着，朝三人低下头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_74566c92:


    "文收到家里的LIME信息说母亲发烧了，于是决定请假回店里帮忙。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_5c19029a:



    voice "2HI_1392"
    hina "「店里最近一直很忙啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_ffcb336b:



    voice "2FU_1134"
    fumi "「本来是不应该为这种事请假的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_8c353cd7:



    voice "2MI_1036"
    miyako "「没办法嘛。毕竟今天是情人节」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_c6310123:



    voice "2FU_1135"
    fumi "「是啊。好巧不巧偏偏今天呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_5d5f665b:



