    fumi "「谢谢。帮大忙了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_0d915f2a:



    voice "2FU_1137"
    fumi "「那便当就晚上来准备——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_4fa76b0a:



    voice "2HI_1394"
    hina "「这种事你就别在意啦。不是还有小卖部嘛。啊，便当盒也得洗一下」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_3c9f186c:



    voice "2MI_1037"
    miyako "「我也来帮忙」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_a3c462ab:


    "没等文说完，阳菜和圣夜子就去了厨房。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_10a104db:



    voice "2FU_1138"
    fumi "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_b53c0689:


    "文感激地合上了手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_50d12ddc:



    voice "2RI_1360"
    rin "「有什么我能做的吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_d920d72d:



