    fumi "「比起这个——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_52289bb6:



    voice "2RI_1362"
    rin "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_e8b74ec3:


    "伦试着搭了好几次话，但却抓不对时机。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_aa771132:


    "阳菜也有所察觉，等待着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_b859a5fc:


    "文也注意到了这些，帮了伦一把。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_7e63456c:



    voice "2RI_1363"
    rin "「阳菜，明天放学后，我想和你谈谈」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_06_fa34fed4:



    voice "2HI_1395"
    hina "「嗯……我知道了」"




